<Base title="Contribute" description="How to contribute to khėnsu.ñü.">
  <p class="eyebrow">Contribute</p>
  <h1>Contribute</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Every repository is public under
    <a href="https://github.com/elliott-wave-labs">elliott-wave-labs</a>.
    Open a pull request on the component you are changing.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Outside contributors sign a contributor licence agreement once, through a bot on your first pull request (<a href="https://github.com/elliott-wave-labs/khensu-specs/blob/main/CLA.md">CLA.md</a>).</li>
    <li>Cryptography and protocol changes need a written design and review before code.</li>
    <li>Nothing may process user data on a server, and no feature may make privacy or stealth optional.</li>
    <li>Install and build the apps from <a href="https://github.com/elliott-wave-labs/khensu-apple/blob/main/docs/INSTALL.md">khensu-apple/docs/INSTALL.md</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:hello@elliottwave.studio?subject=khensu.nu%20contribute">hello@elliottwave.studio</a>.</p>
</Base>
